    prov:wasDerivedFrom pcd:MM-CM-CP-2025 ;
    pc:chunkText "[MM-CM-CP-2025 SECTION 1 - FIRST NOTICE OF LOSS (FNOL) 1.3 p.1] 1.3 At FNOL the adjuster must record: policy number, form edition of MM-CP-0010 in force, all attached endorsements, date of loss, cause of loss, and the scheduled location involved." ;
    pc:classifierRoute "pass1" ;
    pc:clauseText "1.3 At FNOL the adjuster must record: policy number, form edition of MM-CP-0010 in force, all attached endorsements, date of loss, cause of loss, and the scheduled location involved." ;
