pcd:MM-CP-0010_FRONT_T1 a pc:Chunk ;
    rdfs:label "MM-CP-0010 table Field / Value" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom pcd:MM-CP-0010 ;
    pc:chunkText "[MM-CP-0010 Front matter table p.1] Field: Form Number ; Value: MM-CP-0010 | Field: Edition Date ; Value: 01/2025 | Field: Line of Business ; Value: Commercial Property (CP) | Field: Companion Form ; Value: MM-CP-1030 Causes of Loss - Special Form (Ed. 01/2025) | Field: Approved States ; Value: FL (Filing MM-FL-2025-0142), TX (Filing MM-TX-2025-0098)" ;
    pc:pageNumber 1 ;
    pc:sectionRef "Front matter / table" ;
    pc:sourceDocument pcd:MM-CP-0010 .

pcd:MM-CP-0010_SECTION-A_A.1 a pc:Chunk,
        pc:Clause ;
    rdfs:label "MM-CP-0010 A.1" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom pcd:MM-CP-0010 ;
    pc:chunkText "[MM-CP-0010 SECTION A - COVERAGE A.1 p.1] A.1 Insuring Agreement. We will pay for direct physical loss of or damage to Covered Property at the premises described in the Declarations caused by or resulting from any Covered Cause of Loss. Covered Causes of Loss are defined in the Causes of Loss form MM-CP-1030 attached to this policy." ;
    pc:classifierRoute "pass1" ;
    pc:clauseText "A.1 Insuring Agreement. We will pay for direct physical loss of or damage to Covered Property at the premises described in the Declarations caused by or resulting from any Covered Cause of Loss. Covered Causes of Loss are defined in the Causes of Loss form MM-CP-1030 attached to this policy." ;
    pc:confidence 1.0 ;
    pc:deonticType pcd:Permission ;
    pc:groundedTerm pc:Claim,
        pc:Coverage,
        pc:PolicyForm ;
    pc:mentions pcd:MM-CP-1030 ;
    pc:pageNumber 1 ;
    pc:sectionRef "SECTION A - COVERAGE / A.1" ;
    pc:sourceDocument pcd:MM-CP-0010 .

pcd:MM-CP-0010_SECTION-A_A.2 a pc:Chunk,
        pc:Clause ;
    rdfs:label "MM-CP-0010 A.2" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom pcd:MM-CP-0010 ;
    pc:chunkText "[MM-CP-0010 SECTION A - COVERAGE A.2 p.1] A.2 Covered Property. Covered Property, as used in this Coverage Part, means the type of property described in this section and limited in A.3 Property Not Covered, if a Limit of Insurance is shown in the Declarations for that type of property." ;
    pc:classifierRoute "pass1" ;
    pc:clauseText "A.2 Covered Property. Covered Property, as used in this Coverage Part, means the type of property described in this section and limited in A.3 Property Not Covered, if a Limit of Insurance is shown in the Declarations for that type of property." ;
    pc:confidence 1.0 ;
    pc:deonticType pcd:Prohibition ;
    pc:groundedTerm pcd:COV-A,
        pcd:COV-C,
        pc:Coverage ;
    pc:pageNumber 1 ;
    pc:sectionRef "SECTION A - COVERAGE / A.2" ;
    pc:sourceDocument pcd:MM-CP-0010 .

pcd:MM-CP-0010_SECTION-A_A.3_x1 a pc:Clause ;
    pc:clauseText "except vehicles you manufacture, process or warehouse;" ;
    pc:exceptionTo pcd:MM-CP-0010_SECTION-A_A.3 ;
    pc:pageNumber 1 ;
    pc:sectionRef "SECTION A - COVERAGE / A.3 (exception)" ;
    pc:sourceDocument pcd:MM-CP-0010 .

pcd:MM-CP-0010_SECTION-A_A.3_x2 a pc:Clause ;
    pc:clauseText "except as provided in the Coverage Extensions." ;
    pc:exceptionTo pcd:MM-CP-0010_SECTION-A_A.3 ;
    pc:pageNumber 1 ;
    pc:sectionRef "SECTION A - COVERAGE / A.3 (exception)" ;
    pc:sourceDocument pcd:MM-CP-0010 .

pcd:MM-CP-0010_SECTION-A_A.4 a pc:Chunk,
        pc:Clause ;
    rdfs:label "MM-CP-0010 A.4" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom pcd:MM-CP-0010 ;
    pc:chunkText "[MM-CP-0010 SECTION A - COVERAGE A.4 p.1] A.4 Additional Coverages. Debris Removal: We will pay your expense to remove debris of Covered Property caused by a Covered Cause of Loss, subject to a limit of 25% of the amount we pay for the direct physical loss plus the deductible. Preservation of Property: If it is necessary to move Covered Property to preserve it from loss, we will pay for any direct physical loss while it is being moved or stored at another location for up to 30 days." ;
    pc:classifierRoute "pass1" ;
    pc:clauseText "A.4 Additional Coverages. Debris Removal: We will pay your expense to remove debris of Covered Property caused by a Covered Cause of Loss, subject to a limit of 25% of the amount we pay for the direct physical loss plus the deductible. Preservation of Property: If it is necessary to move Covered Property to preserve it from loss, we will pay for any direct physical loss while it is being moved or stored at another location for up to 30 days." ;
    pc:confidence 1.0 ;
    pc:deonticType pcd:Permission ;
    pc:groundedTerm pcd:COV-C,
        pcd:COV-D,
        pc:Coverage ;
    pc:pageNumber 1 ;
    pc:sectionRef "SECTION A - COVERAGE / A.4" ;
    pc:sourceDocument pcd:MM-CP-0010 .

pcd:MM-CP-0010_SECTION-A_T1 a pc:Chunk ;
    rdfs:label "MM-CP-0010 table Coverage Code / Coverage Name / Description" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom pcd:MM-CP-0010 ;
    pc:chunkText "[MM-CP-0010 SECTION A - COVERAGE table p.1] Coverage Code: COV-A ; Coverage Name: Building ; Description: The building or structure described in the Declarations, including completed additions, fixtures, permanently installed machinery and equipment. ; Default Deductible: $2,500 | Coverage Code: COV-B ; Coverage Name: Your Business Personal Property ; Description: Furniture, fixtures, machinery, stock and all other personal property owned by you and used in your business, located in or within 100 feet of the described premises. ; Default Deductible: $2,500 | Coverage Code: COV-C ; Coverage Name: Personal Property of Others ; Description: Personal property of others that is in your care, custody or control and located in or within 100 feet of the described premises. ; Default Deductible: $2,500 | Coverage Code: COV-D ; Coverage Name: Business Income and Extra Expense ; Description: Actual loss of Business Income you sustain due to the necessary suspension of operations during the period of restoration. ; Default Deductible: 72-hour waiting period" ;
    pc:pageNumber 1 ;
    pc:sectionRef "SECTION A - COVERAGE / table" ;
    pc:sourceDocument pcd:MM-CP-0010 .

