    pc:sectionRef "SECTION D - DEDUCTIBLE / D.2" ;
    pc:sourceDocument pcd:MM-CP-0010 .

pcd:MM-CP-0010_SECTION-E_E.1 a pc:Chunk,
        pc:Clause ;
    rdfs:label "MM-CP-0010 E.1" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom pcd:MM-CP-0010 ;
    pc:chunkText "[MM-CP-0010 SECTION E - LOSS CONDITIONS E.1 p.3] E.1 Abandonment. There can be no abandonment of any property to us." ;
    pc:classifierRoute "pass1" ;
    pc:clauseText "E.1 Abandonment. There can be no abandonment of any property to us." ;
    pc:confidence 1.0 ;
    pc:deonticType pcd:Prohibition ;
    pc:groundedTerm pcd:Prohibition,
        pc:AuthorityLevel,
        pc:FormApproval ;
    pc:pageNumber 3 ;
    pc:sectionRef "SECTION E - LOSS CONDITIONS / E.1" ;
    pc:sourceDocument pcd:MM-CP-0010 .

pcd:MM-CP-0010_SECTION-E_E.2 a pc:Chunk,
        pc:Clause ;
    rdfs:label "MM-CP-0010 E.2" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom pcd:MM-CP-0010 ;
    pc:chunkText "[MM-CP-0010 SECTION E - LOSS CONDITIONS E.2 p.3] E.2 Appraisal. If we and you disagree on the value of the property or the amount of loss, either may make written demand for an appraisal of the loss. Each party will select a competent and impartial appraiser within 20 days of the demand." ;
    pc:classifierRoute "pass2-rules" ;
    pc:clauseText "E.2 Appraisal. If we and you disagree on the value of the property or the amount of loss, either may make written demand for an appraisal of the loss. Each party will select a competent and impartial appraiser within 20 days of the demand." ;
    pc:confidence 0.5 ;
    pc:deonticType pcd:Permission ;
    pc:groundedTerm pc:Claim,
        pc:FormApproval,
        pc:StateAmendatoryEndorsement ;
    pc:pageNumber 3 ;
    pc:sectionRef "SECTION E - LOSS CONDITIONS / E.2" ;
    pc:sourceDocument pcd:MM-CP-0010 .

pcd:MM-CP-0010_SECTION-E_E.3 a pc:Chunk,
        pc:Clause ;
    rdfs:label "MM-CP-0010 E.3" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom pcd:MM-CP-0010 ;
    pc:chunkText "[MM-CP-0010 SECTION E - LOSS CONDITIONS E.3 p.3] E.3 Duties In The Event Of Loss Or Damage. You must see that the following are done in the event of loss or damage to Covered Property: (a) Notify the police if a law may have been broken. (b) Give us prompt notice of the loss or damage, and in no event later than 72 hours after you become aware of it, including a description of the property involved. (c) Take all reasonable steps to protect the Covered Property from further damage. (d) Send us a signed, sworn proof of loss containing the information we request within 60 days after our request. (e) Cooperate with us in the investigation or settlement of the claim, and permit us to inspect the property and examine your books and records." ;
    pc:classifierRoute "pass1" ;
    pc:clauseText "E.3 Duties In The Event Of Loss Or Damage. You must see that the following are done in the event of loss or damage to Covered Property: (a) Notify the police if a law may have been broken. (b) Give us prompt notice of the loss or damage, and in no event later than 72 hours after you become aware of it, including a description of the property involved. (c) Take all reasonable steps to protect the Covered Property from further damage. (d) Send us a signed, sworn proof of loss containing the information we request within 60 days after our request. (e) Cooperate with us in the investigation or settlement of the claim, and permit us to inspect the property and examine your books and records." ;
    pc:confidence 0.824 ;
    pc:deonticType pcd:Obligation ;
    pc:groundedTerm pcd:COV-C,
        pcd:COV-D,
        pc:Claim ;
    pc:pageNumber 3 ;
    pc:sectionRef "SECTION E - LOSS CONDITIONS / E.3" ;
    pc:sourceDocument pcd:MM-CP-0010 .

pcd:MM-CP-0010_SECTION-E_E.4 a pc:Chunk,
        pc:Clause ;
    rdfs:label "MM-CP-0010 E.4" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom pcd:MM-CP-0010 ;
    pc:chunkText "[MM-CP-0010 SECTION E - LOSS CONDITIONS E.4 p.3] E.4 Loss Payment. We will give notice of our intentions within 30 days after we receive the sworn proof of loss. We will pay for covered loss or damage within 30 days after we receive the sworn proof of loss, if you have complied with all of the terms of this Coverage Part and we have reached agreement with you on the amount of loss, or an appraisal award has been made." ;
    pc:classifierRoute "pass1" ;
    pc:clauseText "E.4 Loss Payment. We will give notice of our intentions within 30 days after we receive the sworn proof of loss. We will pay for covered loss or damage within 30 days after we receive the sworn proof of loss, if you have complied with all of the terms of this Coverage Part and we have reached agreement with you on the amount of loss, or an appraisal award has been made." ;
    pc:confidence 0.7 ;
    pc:deonticType pcd:Permission ;
    pc:groundedTerm pcd:COV-D,
        pc:Claim,
        pc:Coverage ;
    pc:pageNumber 3 ;
    pc:sectionRef "SECTION E - LOSS CONDITIONS / E.4" ;
    pc:sourceDocument pcd:MM-CP-0010 .

pcd:MM-CP-0010_SECTION-E_E.5_x1 a pc:Clause ;
    pc:clauseText "With respect to Covered Causes of Loss other than those listed, we will reduce the amount we would otherwise pay by 15%." ;
    pc:exceptionTo pcd:MM-CP-0010_SECTION-E_E.5 ;
    pc:pageNumber 3 ;
    pc:sectionRef "SECTION E - LOSS CONDITIONS / E.5 (exception)" ;
    pc:sourceDocument pcd:MM-CP-0010 .

pcd:MM-CP-0010_SECTION-F_F.1 a pc:Chunk,
        pc:Clause ;
    rdfs:label "MM-CP-0010 F.1" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom pcd:MM-CP-0010 ;
    pc:chunkText "[MM-CP-0010 SECTION F - ADDITIONAL CONDITIONS F.1 p.3] F.1 Coinsurance. If a Coinsurance percentage is shown in the Declarations and the value of Covered Property at the time of loss times the Coinsurance percentage is greater than the Limit of Insurance, we will pay only the proportion of the loss that the Limit of Insurance bears to the required amount." ;
    pc:classifierRoute "pass1" ;
    pc:clauseText "F.1 Coinsurance. If a Coinsurance percentage is shown in the Declarations and the value of Covered Property at the time of loss times the Coinsurance percentage is greater than the Limit of Insurance, we will pay only the proportion of the loss that the Limit of Insurance bears to the required amount." ;
    pc:confidence 0.667 ;
    pc:deonticType pcd:Permission ;
    pc:groundedTerm pcd:COV-C,
        pc:Claim,
        pc:Coverage ;
    pc:pageNumber 3 ;
    pc:sectionRef "SECTION F - ADDITIONAL CONDITIONS / F.1" ;
    pc:sourceDocument pcd:MM-CP-0010 .

pcd:MM-CP-0010_SECTION-F_F.2 a pc:Chunk,
        pc:Clause ;
    rdfs:label "MM-CP-0010 F.2" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom pcd:MM-CP-0010 ;
    pc:chunkText "[MM-CP-0010 SECTION F - ADDITIONAL CONDITIONS F.2 p.3] F.2 Mortgageholders. We will pay for covered loss of or damage to buildings to each mortgageholder shown in the Declarations in their order of precedence." ;
    pc:classifierRoute "pass1" ;
    pc:clauseText "F.2 Mortgageholders. We will pay for covered loss of or damage to buildings to each mortgageholder shown in the Declarations in their order of precedence." ;
    pc:confidence 1.0 ;
    pc:deonticType pcd:Permission ;
    pc:groundedTerm pc:AuthorityLevel,
        pc:Claim,
        pc:Coverage ;
    pc:pageNumber 3 ;
    pc:sectionRef "SECTION F - ADDITIONAL CONDITIONS / F.2" ;
    pc:sourceDocument pcd:MM-CP-0010 .

pcd:MM-CP-0010_SECTION-G_G.1 a pc:Chunk,
        pc:Clause ;
    rdfs:label "MM-CP-0010 G.1" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom pcd:MM-CP-0010 ;
    pc:chunkText "[MM-CP-0010 SECTION G - OPTIONAL COVERAGES AND ENDORSEMENTS G.1 p.3] G.1 The following endorsements may be attached to this form when shown in the Declarations: MM-CP-E101 Flood Coverage Endorsement - Scheduled Locations; MM-CP-E205 Equipment Breakdown Endorsement; MM-CP-E310 Windstorm or Hail Percentage Deductible; MM-CP-E415 Protective Safeguards Endorsement. State amendatory endorsements such as MM-CP-FL-01 (Florida) are attached automatically where required by the state filing." ;
    pc:classifierRoute "pass1" ;
    pc:clauseText "G.1 The following endorsements may be attached to this form when shown in the Declarations: MM-CP-E101 Flood Coverage Endorsement - Scheduled Locations; MM-CP-E205 Equipment Breakdown Endorsement; MM-CP-E310 Windstorm or Hail Percentage Deductible; MM-CP-E415 Protective Safeguards Endorsement. State amendatory endorsements such as MM-CP-FL-01 (Florida) are attached automatically where required by the state filing." ;
    pc:confidence 0.75 ;
    pc:deonticType pcd:Permission ;
    pc:groundedTerm pc:Endorsement,
        pc:Form,
        pc:StateAmendatoryEndorsement ;
    pc:mentions pcd:FL,
        pcd:Flood,
        pcd:Hail,
        pcd:MM-CP-E101,
        pcd:MM-CP-E205,
        pcd:MM-CP-E310,
        pcd:MM-CP-E415,
        pcd:MM-CP-FL-01,
        pcd:MechanicalBreakdown,
        pcd:Windstorm ;
    pc:pageNumber 3 ;
    pc:sectionRef "SECTION G - OPTIONAL COVERAGES AND ENDORSEMENTS / G.1" ;
    pc:sourceDocument pcd:MM-CP-0010 .

