    prov:wasDerivedFrom pcd:MM-CP-E-SERIES ;
    pc:chunkText "[MM-CP-E-SERIES 1. MM-CP-E101 - FLOOD COVERAGE ENDORSEMENT - SCHEDULED LOCATIONS (Ed. 06/2025) 1.2 p.1] 1.2 Coverage Grant. Exclusion EXCL-FLD (Water) in Section B.1.g of MM-CP-1030 is deleted with respect to the peril of Flood for the scheduled locations. We will pay for direct physical loss of or damage to Covered Property at a scheduled location caused by Flood, subject to the Flood Sublimit and Flood Deductible shown in the Schedule." ;
    pc:classifierRoute "pass1" ;
