    prov:wasDerivedFrom pcd:MM-RM-CP-2025 ;
    pc:chunkText "[MM-RM-CP-2025 RULE 5 - DEDUCTIBLE FACTORS 5.1 p.3] 5.1 Where MM-CP-E310 Windstorm or Hail Percentage Deductible is attached, apply factor WH-2 (0.92) for a 2% deductible or WH-5 (0.85) for a 5% deductible to the COV-A and COV-B premium in territories FL-T03 and TX-T01." ;
