pcd:MM-UW-CP-2025_SECTION-2_2.1 a pc:Chunk,
        pc:Clause ;
    rdfs:label "MM-UW-CP-2025 2.1" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom pcd:MM-UW-CP-2025 ;
    pc:chunkText "[MM-UW-CP-2025 SECTION 2 - ELIGIBILITY 2.1 p.1] 2.1 Eligible Risks. A risk is eligible if all of the following are true: (a) construction class is CC1 through CC6; (b) Public Protection Class is PC1 through PC8; (c) the building is not vacant and has not been vacant for more than 60 consecutive days in the prior 12 months; (d) Total Insured Value (TIV) does not exceed $25,000,000 per location; (e) the class code is not listed as Prohibited in Section 2.3." ;
    pc:classifierRoute "pass1" ;
    pc:clauseText "2.1 Eligible Risks. A risk is eligible if all of the following are true: (a) construction class is CC1 through CC6; (b) Public Protection Class is PC1 through PC8; (c) the building is not vacant and has not been vacant for more than 60 consecutive days in the prior 12 months; (d) Total Insured Value (TIV) does not exceed $25,000,000 per location; (e) the class code is not listed as Prohibited in Section 2.3." ;
    pc:confidence 0.667 ;
    pc:deonticType pcd:Permission ;
    pc:groundedTerm pcd:COV-A,
        pc:ConstructionClass,
        pc:ProtectionClass ;
    pc:mentions pcd:CC1,
        pcd:CC6,
        pcd:PC1,
        pcd:PC8 ;
    pc:pageNumber 1 ;
    pc:sectionRef "SECTION 2 - ELIGIBILITY / 2.1" ;
    pc:sourceDocument pcd:MM-UW-CP-2025 .

pcd:MM-UW-CP-2025_SECTION-2_2.2 a pc:Chunk,
        pc:Clause ;
    rdfs:label "MM-UW-CP-2025 2.2" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom pcd:MM-UW-CP-2025 ;
    pc:chunkText "[MM-UW-CP-2025 SECTION 2 - ELIGIBILITY 2.2 p.1] 2.2 Referral Risks. The following risks may be written only with Underwriting Manager approval: Protection Class PC9 or PC10; buildings over 50 years old without updated electrical, plumbing, heating and roof within the last 25 years; class code 0921 (Vacant Buildings); any location in FEMA flood zone A, AE, V or VE that does not carry MM-CP-E101." ;
    pc:classifierRoute "pass1" ;
    pc:clauseText "2.2 Referral Risks. The following risks may be written only with Underwriting Manager approval: Protection Class PC9 or PC10; buildings over 50 years old without updated electrical, plumbing, heating and roof within the last 25 years; class code 0921 (Vacant Buildings); any location in FEMA flood zone A, AE, V or VE that does not carry MM-CP-E101." ;
    pc:confidence 1.0 ;
    pc:deonticType pcd:Permission ;
    pc:groundedTerm pcd:Refer,
        pc:FloodZone,
        pc:ProtectionClass ;
    pc:mentions pcd:CC-0921,
        pcd:Flood,
        pcd:MM-CP-E101,
        pcd:PC10,
        pcd:PC9 ;
    pc:pageNumber 1 ;
    pc:sectionRef "SECTION 2 - ELIGIBILITY / 2.2" ;
    pc:sourceDocument pcd:MM-UW-CP-2025 .

pcd:MM-UW-CP-2025_SECTION-2_2.3 a pc:Chunk,
        pc:Clause ;
