    pc:chunkText "[MM-UW-CP-2025 SECTION 2 - ELIGIBILITY 2.3 p.1] 2.3 Prohibited Risks. Underwriters must not quote or bind any risk with class code 0511, any risk with unresolved open fire code violations, or any risk located in a state where form MM-CP-0010 is not approved (currently NY, pending Filing MM-NY-2025-0211)." ;
