pcd:MM-CM-CP-2025_SECTION-1_1.1 a pc:Chunk,
        pc:Clause ;
    rdfs:label "MM-CM-CP-2025 1.1" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom pcd:MM-CM-CP-2025 ;
    pc:chunkText "[MM-CM-CP-2025 SECTION 1 - FIRST NOTICE OF LOSS (FNOL) 1.1 p.1] 1.1 The insured is required by MM-CP-0010 Section E.3(b) to report loss within 72 hours of becoming aware of it; in Florida, MM-CP-FL-01 Section 5.3 extends this period to 14 days. Late notice must not be used to deny a claim unless the delay prejudiced our investigation." ;
    pc:classifierRoute "pass2-rules" ;
    pc:clauseText "1.1 The insured is required by MM-CP-0010 Section E.3(b) to report loss within 72 hours of becoming aware of it; in Florida, MM-CP-FL-01 Section 5.3 extends this period to 14 days. Late notice must not be used to deny a claim unless the delay prejudiced our investigation." ;
    pc:confidence 0.517 ;
    pc:deonticType pcd:Obligation ;
    pc:groundedTerm pc:Claim,
        pc:Coverage,
        pc:PolicyForm ;
    pc:mentions pcd:FL,
        pcd:MM-CP-0010,
        pcd:MM-CP-FL-01 ;
    pc:pageNumber 1 ;
    pc:sectionRef "SECTION 1 - FIRST NOTICE OF LOSS (FNOL) / 1.1" ;
    pc:sourceDocument pcd:MM-CM-CP-2025 .

pcd:MM-CM-CP-2025_SECTION-2_2.3 a pc:Chunk,
        pc:Clause ;
    rdfs:label "MM-CM-CP-2025 2.3" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom pcd:MM-CM-CP-2025 ;
    pc:chunkText "[MM-CM-CP-2025 SECTION 2 - COVERAGE VERIFICATION 2.3 p.1] 2.3 If MM-CP-E101 is attached and the premises is a scheduled location, Flood damage to COV-A and COV-B is covered up to the Flood Sublimit of $250,000 subject to the 5% Flood Deductible; COV-D is not covered unless the Schedule shows a COV-D Flood Sublimit." ;
    pc:classifierRoute "pass2-rules" ;
    pc:clauseText "2.3 If MM-CP-E101 is attached and the premises is a scheduled location, Flood damage to COV-A and COV-B is covered up to the Flood Sublimit of $250,000 subject to the 5% Flood Deductible; COV-D is not covered unless the Schedule shows a COV-D Flood Sublimit." ;
    pc:confidence 0.565 ;
    pc:deonticType pcd:Permission ;
    pc:groundedTerm pcd:COV-D,
        pcd:CommercialProperty,
        pcd:Flood ;
    pc:mentions pcd:COV-A,
        pcd:COV-B,
        pcd:COV-D,
        pcd:Flood,
        pcd:MM-CP-E101 ;
    pc:pageNumber 1 ;
    pc:sectionRef "SECTION 2 - COVERAGE VERIFICATION / 2.3" ;
    pc:sourceDocument pcd:MM-CM-CP-2025 .

pcd:MM-CP-0010_SECTION-B_B.1 a pc:Chunk,
        pc:Clause ;
    rdfs:label "MM-CP-0010 B.1" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom pcd:MM-CP-0010 ;
    pc:chunkText "[MM-CP-0010 SECTION B - EXCLUSIONS AND LIMITATIONS B.1 p.2] B.1 See the applicable Causes of Loss form MM-CP-1030 for exclusions and limitations. The exclusions EXCL-FLD (Water), EXCL-EQ (Earth Movement), EXCL-WAR (War and Military Action), EXCL-MOLD (Fungus, Wet Rot and Bacteria) and EXCL-WEAR (Wear and Tear) apply to Coverages COV-A, COV-B, COV-C and COV-D unless an endorsement attached to this policy states otherwise." ;
    pc:classifierRoute "pass2-rules" ;
    pc:clauseText "B.1 See the applicable Causes of Loss form MM-CP-1030 for exclusions and limitations. The exclusions EXCL-FLD (Water), EXCL-EQ (Earth Movement), EXCL-WAR (War and Military Action), EXCL-MOLD (Fungus, Wet Rot and Bacteria) and EXCL-WEAR (Wear and Tear) apply to Coverages COV-A, COV-B, COV-C and COV-D unless an endorsement attached to this policy states otherwise." ;
    pc:confidence 0.34 ;
    pc:deonticType pcd:Permission ;
    pc:groundedTerm pc:Claim,
        pc:Exclusion,
        pc:PolicyForm ;
    pc:mentions pcd:COV-A,
        pcd:COV-B,
        pcd:COV-C,
        pcd:COV-D,
        pcd:EXCL-EQ,
        pcd:EXCL-FLD,
        pcd:EXCL-MOLD,
        pcd:EXCL-WAR,
        pcd:EXCL-WEAR,
        pcd:EarthMovement,
        pcd:MM-CP-1030,
        pcd:Mold,
        pcd:Water ;
    pc:pageNumber 2 ;
    pc:sectionRef "SECTION B - EXCLUSIONS AND LIMITATIONS / B.1" ;
    pc:sourceDocument pcd:MM-CP-0010 .

pcd:MM-CP-0010_SECTION-E_E.5 a pc:Chunk,
        pc:Clause ;
    rdfs:label "MM-CP-0010 E.5" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom pcd:MM-CP-0010 ;
    pc:chunkText "[MM-CP-0010 SECTION E - LOSS CONDITIONS E.5 p.3] E.5 Vacancy. If the building where loss or damage occurs has been vacant for more than 60 consecutive days before that loss or damage occurs, we will not pay for any loss or damage caused by vandalism, sprinkler leakage, building glass breakage, water damage, theft or attempted theft. With respect to Covered Causes of Loss other than those listed, we will reduce the amount we would otherwise pay by 15%." ;
    pc:classifierRoute "pass1" ;
    pc:clauseText "E.5 Vacancy. If the building where loss or damage occurs has been vacant for more than 60 consecutive days before that loss or damage occurs, we will not pay for any loss or damage caused by vandalism, sprinkler leakage, building glass breakage, water damage, theft or attempted theft. With respect to Covered Causes of Loss other than those listed, we will reduce the amount we would otherwise pay by 15%." ;
    pc:confidence 1.0 ;
    pc:deonticType pcd:Prohibition ;
    pc:groundedTerm pcd:Vandalism,
        pc:Claim,
        pc:Location ;
    pc:mentions pcd:SprinklerLeakage,
        pcd:Theft,
        pcd:Vandalism,
        pcd:Water ;
    pc:pageNumber 3 ;
    pc:sectionRef "SECTION E - LOSS CONDITIONS / E.5" ;
    pc:sourceDocument pcd:MM-CP-0010 .

pcd:MM-CP-E-SERIES_1-MM-CP-E101_1.3 a pc:Chunk,
        pc:Clause ;
    rdfs:label "MM-CP-E-SERIES 1.3" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom pcd:MM-CP-E-SERIES ;
    pc:chunkText "[MM-CP-E-SERIES 1. MM-CP-E101 - FLOOD COVERAGE ENDORSEMENT - SCHEDULED LOCATIONS (Ed. 06/2025) 1.3 p.1] 1.3 Flood Deductible. A deductible of 5% of the Limit of Insurance for COV-A at the scheduled location applies to each Flood occurrence, but not less than $25,000. This deductible replaces the deductible in Section D of MM-CP-0010 for the peril of Flood only." ;
    pc:classifierRoute "pass2-rules" ;
    pc:clauseText "1.3 Flood Deductible. A deductible of 5% of the Limit of Insurance for COV-A at the scheduled location applies to each Flood occurrence, but not less than $25,000. This deductible replaces the deductible in Section D of MM-CP-0010 for the peril of Flood only." ;
    pc:confidence 0.34 ;
    pc:deonticType pcd:Permission ;
    pc:groundedTerm pcd:CommercialProperty,
        pcd:Flood,
        pc:FloodZone ;
    pc:mentions pcd:COV-A,
        pcd:Flood,
        pcd:MM-CP-0010 ;
    pc:pageNumber 1 ;
